5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe it is wise to look at what has actually been delivered. I shall review the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the human element. I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to see the state of our shared resources. I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the real value of these grants is shifting. I will look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to know where the hidden delays are. I'll check the station records from partner field sites and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
